#. module: timesheet_grid
#: model:mail.template,body_html:timesheet_grid.mail_template_timesheet_reminder_user
msgid ""
"<t>\n"
"<t t-set=\"timesheet_hours\" t-value=\"ctx.get('timesheet_hours', 0)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"working_hours\" t-value=\"ctx.get('working_hours', 0)\"/>\n"
"Hello <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\">Abigail Peterson</t>,<br/><br/>\n"
"This is a friendly reminder to log your hours for the following period: <t t-"
"out=\"ctx.get('date_start') or ''\">05/05/2021</t> <i class=\"oi\" data-"
"icon=\"east\"/> <t t-out=\"ctx.get('date_stop') or ''\">05/06/2021</t>.\n"
"For the time being, you <t t-if=\"timesheet_hours != 0\">only</t> logged <t "
"t-out=\"'%d' %int(timesheet_hours)\">2</t><t t-if=\"timesheet_hours % 1 != "
"0\" t-out=\"':%02d' % (round(timesheet_hours % 1 * 60))\">:30</t> hours on "
"the <t t-out=\"'%d' %int(working_hours)\">8</t><t t-if=\"working_hours % 1 !"
"= 0\" t-out=\"':%02d' % (round(working_hours % 1 * 60))\">:30</t> requested."
"<br/>\n"
"<div t-if=\"ctx.get('action_url')\" style=\"margin: 16px 0px 16px 0px;\">\n"
"    <a t-att-href=\"ctx.get('action_url')\" t-attf-style=\"background-color: "
"{{object.company_id.email_secondary_color or '#875A7B'}};; padding: 8px 16px "
"8px 16px; text-decoration: none; color: "
"{{object.company_id.email_primary_color or '#FFFFFF'}}; border-radius: 5px; "
"font-size: 13px;\">Fill in your timesheet</a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br/>Thank you,<br/>\n"
"<t t-if=\"user.signature\">\n"
"    <div data-o-mail-quote=\"1\">--<br data-o-mail-quote=\"1\"/><t t-"
"out=\"user.signature or ''\">Mitchell Admin</t></div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"            </t>"
msgstr ""
"<t>\n"
"<t t-set=\"timesheet_hours\" t-value=\"ctx.get('timesheet_hours', 0)\"/>\n"
"<t t-set=\"working_hours\" t-value=\"ctx.get('working_hours', 0)\"/>\n"
"안녕하세요 <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\">Abigail Peterson</t>님,<br/><br/>\n"
"다음 기간에 대한 근무 시간 기록을 제출해 주세요: <t t-"
"out=\"ctx.get('date_start') or ''\">05/05/2021</t> <i class=\"oi\" data-"
"icon=\"east\"/> <t t-out=\"ctx.get('date_stop') or ''\">05/06/2021</t>.\n"
"현재까지 기록된 시간은 <t t-if=\"timesheet_hours != 0\">단</t><t t-"
"out=\"'%d' %int(timesheet_hours)\">2</t><t t-if=\"timesheet_hours % 1 != 0\" "
"t-out=\"':%02d' % (round(timesheet_hours % 1 * 60))\">:30</t> 시간이며, 제출"
"한 시간은 <t t-out=\"'%d' %int(working_hours)\">8</t><t t-if=\"working_hours "
"% 1 != 0\" t-out=\"':%02d' % (round(working_hours % 1 * 60))\">:30</t> 입니"
"다.<br/>\n"
"<div t-if=\"ctx.get('action_url')\" style=\"margin: 16px 0px 16px 0px;\">\n"
"    <a t-att-href=\"ctx.get('action_url')\" t-attf-style=\"background-color: "
"{{object.company_id.email_secondary_color or '#875A7B'}};; padding: 8px 16px "
"8px 16px; text-decoration: none; color: "
"{{object.company_id.email_primary_color or '#FFFFFF'}}; border-radius: 5px; "
"font-size: 13px;\">작업시간표 작성하기</a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br/>감사합니다.<br/>\n"
"<t t-if=\"user.signature\">\n"
"    <div data-o-mail-quote=\"1\">--<br data-o-mail-quote=\"1\"/><t t-"
"out=\"user.signature or ''\">Mitchell Admin</t></div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"            </t>"

#. module: timesheet_grid
#: model:mail.template,body_html:timesheet_grid.mail_template_timesheet_reminder
msgid ""
"<t>\n"
"Hello <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\">Abigail Peterson</t>,<br/><br/>\n"
"This is a friendly reminder to approve your team's timesheets for the "
"following period: <t t-out=\"ctx.get('date_start') or ''\">05/05/2021</t> - "
"<t t-out=\"ctx.get('date_stop') or ''\">06/05/2021</t>.<br/>\n"
"<div t-if=\"ctx.get('action_url')\" style=\"margin: 16px 0px 16px 0px;\">\n"
"    <a t-att-href=\"ctx.get('action_url')\" t-attf-style=\"background-color: "
"{{object.company_id.email_secondary_color or '#875A7B'}}; padding: 8px 16px "
"8px 16px; text-decoration: none; color: "
"{{object.company_id.email_primary_color or '#FFFFFF'}}; border-radius: 5px; "
"font-size: 13px;\">Validate the Timesheets</a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br/>Thank you,<br/>\n"
"<t t-if=\"user.signature\">\n"
"    <div data-o-mail-quote=\"1\">--<br data-o-mail-quote=\"1\"/><t t-"
"out=\"user.signature or ''\">Mitchell Admin</t></div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"            </t>"
msgstr ""
"<t>\n"
"안녕하세요 <t t-out=\"object.name or ''\">Abigail Peterson</t>님,<br/><br/>\n"
"다음의 기간에 대한 팀의 작업시간표를 승인해 주세요: <t t-"
"out=\"ctx.get('date_start') or ''\">05/05/2021</t> - <t t-"
"out=\"ctx.get('date_stop') or ''\">06/05/2021</t>.<br/>\n"
"<div t-if=\"ctx.get('action_url')\" style=\"margin: 16px 0px 16px 0px;\">\n"
"    <a t-att-href=\"ctx.get('action_url')\" t-attf-style=\"background-color: "
"{{object.company_id.email_secondary_color or '#875A7B'}}; padding: 8px 16px "
"8px 16px; text-decoration: none; color: "
"{{object.company_id.email_primary_color or '#FFFFFF'}}; border-radius: 5px; "
"font-size: 13px;\">작업시간표 승인하기</a>\n"
"</div>\n"
"<br/>감사합니다.<br/>\n"
"<t t-if=\"user.signature\">\n"
"    <div data-o-mail-quote=\"1\">--<br data-o-mail-quote=\"1\"/><t t-"
"out=\"user.signature or ''\">Mitchell Admin</t></div>\n"
"</t>\n"
"            </t>"

